            "altEn": "Hoya stands by a stream in a valley, peaks rising on both sides."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "narrationEn": "Jirisan is home to the Asiatic black bear, {kw:gom}. These bears had become very rare there, and they were in danger of disappearing.",
          "captionEn": "The black bears of Jirisan",
          "keyword": {
            "id": "gom",
            "ko": "곰",
            "romanization": "gom",
