            "altEn": "Hoya looks thoughtful among the pines of a quiet mountain."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s5",
          "narrationEn": "So a project to bring the bears back began in Jirisan National Park. Bears of the same kind came from Russia, North Korea and northeast China, and were set free in the mountain.",
